  "metadata": {
    "id": "murmur-wide-saw",
    "name": "WIDE SAW",
    "author": "Patchwork Eight Engineering",
    "description": "Six detuned saw carriers (OP0-5) spread across slightly-off frequencyRatios, plus a sub-octave doubler on OP5. Proves that a hand-detuned cluster stays level-controlled and doesn't collapse -- a preview of what the future unison engine will automate (docs/ROADMAP.md Phase 7). Filter 1 (lowpass, keyTrack=0.5) plus a Velocity -> FilterCutoff route give classic velocity-sensitive brightness.",
